<title>POLAND: Polish Bank Komunalny wants bourse debut Sept 19.</title>
<headline>Polish Bank Komunalny wants bourse debut Sept 19.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Bank Komunalny SA w Gdyni wants to enter the main market of the Warsaw Stock Exchange on September 19, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bourse's board earlier this month cleared the 3.3 million Bank Komunalny's shares for trade.</p>
<p>Bank Komunalny had a 6.5 million zloty net profit last year on interest and other income of 20.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Malgorzata Rzepka +48 22 653 9700</p>
